OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment orders rapid review
OL,4,Ainto district council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has ordered a rapid
OL,7,Freview into Ashfield District Council
OL,8,Fafter concerns were raised about its
OL,9,Fleadership and governance.
OL,11,FIn a letter to Labour MP Michelle
OL,12,FWelsh, local government minister Jim
OL,13,FMcMahon confirmed he had ordered a
OL,14,F"rapid best value assessment" to be
OL,15,Fcarried out into the Nottinghamshire
OL,16,Fauthority, which is run by Ashfield
OL,17,FIndependents.
OL,19,FIt follows the conviction of the former
OL,20,Fcouncil leader Jason Zadrozny, for
OL,21,Ffraud and tax evasion in September.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
